  "verdict": "inconclusive",
  "change": "Up to v1.2 Deflect added its cost once to an enemy spell or ability that chose the unit. v1.3 made it apply for each time the unit is chosen, and v1.4 kept that while changing \"choose\" to \"target\". Old answer (v1.1-1.2): once. Answer since v1.3: once per choice, so twice.",
